  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Develop evidence-based subsidies (data platform, methodologies/tools, educational activities and studies /research, making use of advanced technologies and innovation) to enhance PNUD &#x2013; CO in support to national and subnational governments capacity to formulate, monitor and evaluate public policies ,programmes and projects (including the ones developed in partnership with UNDP), as well as provide relevant inputs and tools for enhanced analytical capacity and decision-making by academia/think tanks, private sector and other national players and stakeholders, supporting national, regional and local development towards the SDGs.</narrative>
  </description>
